<title>UK: FEK sets 10 bln yen dual currency three-year bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 10 bln yen dual currency three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and Sumitomo Trust International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT CORPORATION</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON    *4.80 PCT  MATURITY    17.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.60	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 500	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES     *REDEMPTION IS IN U.S. DOLLARS.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
